          <span>How does IPES guarantee evaluator confidentiality?</span>
          <span class="text-slate-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">&darr;</span>
        </summary>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          Evaluator identities are decoupled at the database level. When scorecards are generated, numerical scores are mathematically averaged by category, and qualitative comments are compiled into a randomized list stripped of all author identifiers, timestamps, and IP addresses.
        </p>
      </details>

